{"t":"HLT","made":"2026-11-06 14:38","name":"Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc. Common Stock","ko":null,"sector":"Consumer Cyclical","industry":"Lodging","employees":182000,"hq":"McLean, VA, United States","website":"https://www.hilton.com","summary_en":"Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc., a hospitality company, engages in managing, franchising, and leasing hotels and resorts. It operates in two segments, Management and Franchise, and Ownership. The company engages in the hotel management and licensing of its brand names, trademarks, and service marks. It operates a brand portfolio of luxury, lifestyle, full service, focused service, all-suites hotel, and timeshare under the Waldorf Astoria Hotels & Resorts, LXR Hotels & Resorts, Conrad Hotels & Resorts, Signia by Hilton, NoMad, Canopy by Hilton, Graduate by Hilton, Tempo by Hilton, Motto by Hilton, Hilton Hotels & Resorts, DoubleTree by Hilton, Curio Collection by Hilton, Tapestry Collection by Hilton, Outset Collection by Hilton, Embassy Suites by Hilton, Homewood Suites by Hilton, Home2 Suites by Hilton, LivSmart Studios by Hilton, Hilton Garden Inn, Hampton by Hilton, Tru by Hilton, Spark by Hilton, Hilton Grand Vacations, Small Luxury Hotels of the World, AutoCamp, and Hilton Honors brand names. The company has operations in North America, South America, and Central America, including various Caribbean nations; Europe, the Middle East, and Africa; and the Asia Pacific. Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc. was founded in 1919 and is headquartered in McLean, Virginia.","quote_type":"EQUITY","summary_ko":"숙박업 회사인 Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc.는 호텔과 리조트의 관리, 프랜차이즈 및 임대 서비스를 제공합니다. 이는 관리 및 프랜차이즈와 소유권이라는 두 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 회사는 호텔 관리 및 브랜드 이름, 상표 및 서비스 마크에 대한 라이선싱 업무를 담당합니다. Waldorf Astoria Hotels & Resorts, LXR Hotels & Resorts, Conrad Hotels & Resorts, Signia by Hilton, NoMad, Canopy by Hilton, Graduate by Hilton, Tempo by Hilton, Motto by Hilton, Hilton Hotels & Resorts, DoubleTree by Hilton, Curio Collection by Hilton, Tapestry Collection by Hilton, Outset Collection by Hilton, Embassy Suites by Hilton, Homewood Suites by Hilton, Home2 Suites by Hilton, LivSmart Studios by Hilton, Hilton Garden Inn, Hampton by Hilton, Tru by Hilton, Spark by Hilton, Hilton Grand Vacations, Small Luxury Hotels of the World, AutoCamp 및 Hilton Honors 브랜드 이름입니다. 이 회사는 다양한 카리브해 국가를 포함하여 북미, 남미 및 중미에서 사업을 운영하고 있습니다. 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카; 그리고 아시아 태평양. Hilton Worldwide Holdings Inc.는 1919년에 설립되었으며 버지니아 주 맥클린에 본사를 두고 있습니다.","val":{"price":376.53,"mcap":83779559424.0,"pe":51.792297,"fpe":35.986946,"peg":2.0483,"ps":16.176785,"pb":-12.740839,"ev_ebitda":29.587,"div":0.16,"beta":1.071,"hi52":381.34,"lo52":263.66},"fin":{"rev":5178999808.0,"rev_g":0.058,"eps_g":0.331,"gross":0.79455,"op":0.66789,"net":0.32825002,"roe":null,"fcf":1472375040.0,"cash":774000000.0,"debt":13971999744.0,"de":null,"eps":7.27,"feps":10.46296},"own":{"short":0.0256,"inst":0.97428,"insider":0.0222},"analyst":{"n":27,"mean":367.77777,"median":375.0,"high":421.0,"low":275.0,"rec":"buy","recMean":1.86207,"trend":[{"index":0,"period":"0m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":1,"period":"-1m","strongBuy":4,"buy":15,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":2,"period":"-2m","strongBuy":4,"buy":13,"hold":10,"sell":0,"strongSell":1},{"index":3,"period":"-3m","strongBuy":4,"buy":13,"hold":9,"sell":0,"strongSell":1}]},"changes":[{"GradeDate":"2026-11-03","Firm":"Citigroup","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":400.0,"priorPriceTarget":335.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-30","Firm":"Argus Research","ToGrade":"Buy","FromGrade":"Buy","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":410.0,"priorPriceTarget":400.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Macquarie","ToGrade":"Neutral","FromGrade":"Neutral","Action":"main","priceTargetAction":"Raises","currentPriceTarget":333.0,"priorPriceTarget":330.0},{"GradeDate":"2026-10-29","Firm":"Mizuho","ToGrade":"Outperform"